{
 "database": "NI_hackathon_data",
 "schema": "dbo",
 "source": "NI_Table_Schema.xlsx (design document). The service must merge this with the live INFORMATION_SCHEMA; live column names win.",
 "tables": [
  {
   "table": "PlanDetails",
   "layer": "golden",
   "description": "One row per Medicare Advantage plan bid (BidId = contract-plan-segment). Benefits and star rating. Not every BidId in PlanNetworkMapping exists here.",
   "columns": [
    {
     "name": "BidId",
     "type": "Varchar(20)",
     "pk": true
    },
    {
     "name": "PlanName",
     "type": "Varchar(100)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "OverAllStarRating",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "MonthlyPremium",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "HealthDeductible",
     "type": "Varchar(100)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "MOOP",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "PartBGiveBack",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "StarRatingYear",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "BidIds from Landscape/PlanDetails table are limited , Network and Bid mapping from Ideon might contain additional BidIds, hence no Foreign key at BidId level in PlanNetworkMapping. We can add Networktable Bidids without additional info. in PlanDetails table."
   ]
  },
  {
   "table": "ProviderDetails",
   "layer": "golden",
   "description": "One row per provider NPI (individual practitioners). Names and dual-eligible flag.",
   "columns": [
    {
     "name": "NPI",
     "type": "Varchar(10)",
     "pk": true
    },
    {
     "name": "SecondaryNPI",
     "type": "Varchar(10)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "PresentationName",
     "type": "Varchar(100)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "FirstName",
     "type": "Varchar(50)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "LastName",
     "type": "Varchar(50)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "IsDualProvider",
     "type": "Varchar(3)",
     "pk": false
    }
   ],
   "notes": []
  },
  {
   "table": "Speciality",
   "layer": "golden",
   "description": "Specialty lookup. Use HWAISpecialtyDescription for user-facing specialty names (e.g. 'Cardiology').",
   "columns": [
    {
     "name": "SpecialityCode",
     "type": "Varchar(5)",
     "pk": true
    },
    {
     "name": "HWAISpecialtyDescription",
     "type": "Varchar(100)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "SubSpecialityName",
     "type": "Varchar(100)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "NPIType",
     "type": "Varchar(100)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "SpecialtyName",
     "type": "Varchar(100)",
     "pk": false
    }
   ],
   "notes": []
  },
  {
   "table": "LanguageProviderMapping",
   "layer": "golden",
   "description": "Languages a provider speaks.",
   "columns": [
    {
     "name": "NPI",
     "type": "Varchar(10)",
     "pk": false,
     "references": "ProviderDetails.NPI"
    },
    {
     "name": "Language",
     "type": "Varchar(50)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "LanguageProficiency",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    }
   ],
   "notes": []
  },
  {
   "table": "ProviderScoreDetails",
   "layer": "golden",
   "description": "Provider quality/cost/utilization scores at NPI x FIPS x specialty level (PCP scores are at NPI x FIPS level). Non-numeric scores are stored as -1.",
   "columns": [
    {
     "name": "NPI",
     "type": "Varchar(10)",
     "pk": false,
     "references": "ProviderDetails.NPI"
    },
    {
     "name": "FIPS",
     "type": "Varchar(5)",
     "pk": false,
     "references": "County.FIPS"
    },
    {
     "name": "SpecialityCode",
     "type": "Varchar(5)",
     "pk": false,
     "references": "Speciality.SpecialityCode"
    },
    {
     "name": "QualityScore",
     "type": "Int",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "MAUtilizationScore",
     "type": "Int",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "QualityScoreConfidence",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "FFSUtilizationScore",
     "type": "Int",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "CostScore",
     "type": "Int",
     "pk": false
    },
    {
     "name": "CostScoreConfidence",
     "type": "Varchar(25)",
     "pk": false
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "These scores are at 2 level, for PCP it is at NPI*FIPS*New_Flag level, while others are at NPI*FIPS*Speciality level. This should be changes from Prod. team and require Speciality values against PCP(even if scores remain same). Informed Aviral"
   ]
  },
  {
   "table": "LanguageGeographyMapping",
